---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import PublicSector from '../components/sections/PublicSector.astro';
import { publicSectorMailto, CONTACT } from '../config/site';
---
<Base
  title="Public sector partners"
  description="The Active AI momentum engine for councils, active travel, public health, sport governing bodies and physical activity partners: getting people moving and keeping them moving. WeRoam shows how."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Public sector partners" title="Same engine. Different outcome.">
    Councils, active travel teams, public health partners, sport governing bodies and physical activity partners use the same momentum engine to get people moving and
    keep them moving. The moment it finds is not a sale. It is the point where a nudge, a challenge or a crew keeps
    someone active.
  </PageHero>
  <PublicSector />

  <section class="band band--chalk" aria-labelledby="ps-next-title">
    <div class="wrap next">
      <p class="eyebrow">Next step</p>
      <h2 id="ps-next-title">Got a programme to get people moving?</h2>
      <p class="lede muted">Tell us about your residents and what you need to show your funders. We will come back with how the engine would work for you.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={publicSectorMailto()}>Talk to us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <p class="muted small">Or email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .next { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; justify-items: start; }
  .next .eyebrow, .next p, .next h2 { margin: 0; }
  .small { font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
